Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: First of all, I would like to convey, to manifest my satisfaction to the three years struggle that I have.

3743
04:15:00,000 --> 04:15:13,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Concerns niya, more or less, kahit wala na namang tubig yung isang pumping doon dahil solar nga lang siya, at least may ginawa.

3744
04:15:13,900 --> 04:15:18,720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: At least may action na po.

3745
04:15:20,160 --> 04:15:26,380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ilang katanungan lang, my good friend, the distinct sponsor.

3746
04:15:26,380 --> 04:15:36,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa 2027 NEP, nakita ko na bumaba yung budget ng NIA.

3747
04:15:37,580 --> 04:15:48,680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang proposal, ang 2026 dati ay 63.2 billion, pero ngayon 46.3 billion na lang.

3748
04:15:49,380 --> 04:15:54,440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Reduction of 26%. Tama po ba, distinct sponsor?

3749
04:15:54,440 --> 04:16:11,440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Tungkol po sa budget, kung titignan po natin, ang proposed budget for 2027 ay 232,788,000,000.

3750
04:16:12,440 --> 04:16:18,180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Compared to NEP 2027 ay 46 billion 355.

3751
04:16:18,180 --> 04:16:22,180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So ito ay lumalabas pong 19.9%.

3752
04:16:22,180 --> 04:16:24,180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yan ho ang difference.

3753
04:16:24,440 --> 04:16:29,440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pababa po siya, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3754
04:16:30,120 --> 04:16:43,280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, dahil bumaba po, may I ask, which projects or programs account for most of the reduction?

3755
04:16:43,720 --> 04:16:49,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alin po bang mga programa natin ang nabawasan?

3756
04:16:50,540 --> 04:16:53,240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Well, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

3757
04:16:54,440 --> 04:16:56,900
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kung titignan po natin, by ratio and proportion,

3758
04:16:57,760 --> 04:17:03,820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: almost po, kasi nakikita po natin sa restoration, improvements, and rehabilitations,

3759
04:17:04,520 --> 04:17:12,560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: versus yung generation ng bagong patubig, ay nandun sa 30 to 35%.

3760
04:17:12,560 --> 04:17:23,340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So kung titignan po natin, naka-appropriated po, kumbaga, iayos po siya na mabuti.

3761
04:17:23,340 --> 04:17:38,500
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Hindi lang po natin may himay-himay isa-isa, sapagkat marami pong items, marami pong, ayun nga, ulitin natin, maraming items na talagang hindi ho sapat yung oras para mabigyan ko.

3762
04:17:38,560 --> 04:17:48,120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Anyway, kung gusto ho niyong makita, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, pwede ho kami magbigay ng kung ano yung natamaan na lugar o hindi na pondohan.

3763
04:17:48,120 --> 04:17:53,120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero rest assured po na talagang kung titignan po natin yung pondo for next year, 2027,

3764
04:17:53,340 --> 04:18:09,780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay talagang more or less nasa 30 to 35% po ang rehabilitation or yung restoration versus dun sa pagkakonvert ng bagong patubig, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3765
04:18:10,780 --> 04:18:12,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

3766
04:18:13,800 --> 04:18:22,460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano po ba yung nakapaloob sa restoration program? Ano po bang ibig sabihin ng programang ito, restoration program?

3767
04:18:23,340 --> 04:18:26,260
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Marami pong consideration, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3768
04:18:27,000 --> 04:18:40,240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa restoration po kasi, andyan ho yung dating pwedeng nasira during calamities, typhoon, nagkaroon ng displacement, nagkaroon ng erosions.

3769
04:18:40,840 --> 04:18:46,020
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So, kailangan natin i-restore yung kanal, i-restore natin yung facilities, etc., etc. po.

3770
04:18:46,380 --> 04:18:53,300
