3771
04:18:53,340 --> 04:18:59,080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Halos almost parehas lang din sila sa repair and improvements, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3772
04:18:59,680 --> 04:19:01,120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

3773
04:19:01,700 --> 04:19:10,980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasama po ba yung restoration program dun sa mga kagaya nung nireklamo ko noon tapos nire-restore nila ngayon?

3774
04:19:11,700 --> 04:19:13,540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasama po ba yung mga kaso na yun?

3775
04:19:15,480 --> 04:19:21,680
