3777
04:19:26,520 --> 04:19:36,080
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi minsan po, over time, yung napondohan ngayon by phase, talagang hindi naman kasi kayang sabay-sabay.

3778
04:19:37,740 --> 04:19:46,280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pag gagawin na po natin, may makikita pa tayong for improvements, for repair, for restoration, na gagamit din po yun.

3779
04:19:46,280 --> 04:19:51,740
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At mayroon ngayon, katulad nabanggit po natin, dahil sa mga calamities,

3780
04:19:51,740 --> 04:19:55,160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh, nagagamit din yung pondong sa restorations.

3781
04:19:55,580 --> 04:19:58,340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kumbaga, generic po siya kung susumahin po natin.

3782
04:19:58,740 --> 04:20:04,820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Para at least yung nagawa na po natin mga kanal, yung mga bagay-bagay na nasira,

3783
04:20:05,280 --> 04:20:08,640
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ay yung pondo para sa restoration ay magamit.

3784
04:20:08,960 --> 04:20:12,800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Irregalde sa NIS o pwede sa CIS.

3785
04:20:13,020 --> 04:20:14,440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3786
04:20:15,460 --> 04:20:18,140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Salamat po sa paliwanag, Distinguished Sponsor.

3787
04:20:18,140 --> 04:20:21,180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, alam naman po ng National Irrigation,

3788
04:20:21,740 --> 04:20:30,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang forecast po ng pag-asa hanggang pa po sa first quarter ng 2027.

3789
04:20:31,140 --> 04:20:44,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: With that, no, given forecast, mayroon po bang kasama sa proposed budget ng NIA sa 2027

3790
04:20:44,020 --> 04:20:51,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: that will constitute NIA's Drought Resiliency Program,

