04:20:51,260 --> 04:20:52,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: or strategy?

3792
04:20:55,620 --> 04:21:05,940
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ah, mayroon po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yun po yung sa Quick Response Fund natin na humigit kumuulang na 400 million para sa area po ng inyong nabanggit,

3793
04:21:05,940 --> 04:21:07,380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

3794
04:21:08,640 --> 04:21:21,240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, ah, one of the example, yung sa area namin, no, nakapag-ano na kami ng, ng, anong tawag sa Tagalog, no,

3795
04:21:21,260 --> 04:21:37,400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi na kami tumuloy, kasi, yun nga, ah, hindi na kakayanin ng taubig yung, ah, ano, dahil sa drought.

3796
04:21:37,640 --> 04:21:47,900
