3797
04:21:47,900 --> 04:21:49,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you.

3798
04:21:51,260 --> 04:21:58,820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, ang tinutukoy po ba ng ating buting kasamaan dito ay, ah, walang tubig o patutubigan?

3799
