Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pwede na, ho, sila muna mag-ship doon at hindi masyado siyang nangangailangan ng tubig.

3824
04:24:36,420 --> 04:24:44,380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pangalawa, pwede rin, ho, siguro, dahil nakita niyo na, ho, yung, ah, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, yung nagiging problema dyan,

3825
04:24:44,480 --> 04:24:49,840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: pwede, ho, siguro, bilangin niyo yung numbers of, ah, farmers within the,

3826
04:24:49,860 --> 04:24:57,420
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: sa area, tapos maggawa na lang po kayo ng, ah, man-made lagoon, gumawa ho tayo, capital back ho lang naman po yun.

3827
04:24:57,880 --> 04:25:06,380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Bilangin niyo, ho, yung area na gagamit sa isang cycle during summer, at yung gagawin, ho, yung, ah, parang swimming pool ho yun, yung short.

3828
