Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yun yung isa sa alternative na nakikita mo natin solution, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague.

3830
04:25:16,340 --> 04:25:18,820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming salamat po.

3831
04:25:19,860 --> 04:25:25,720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yun yung sponsor sa, ah, paliwanag at sa mga recommendations, no.

3832
04:25:26,360 --> 04:25:37,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ah, ito na lang yung last ko na katanungan, although walo pa to, pero hindi ko na tataposin kasi may mga kasamahan ako na darating.

3833
04:25:37,840 --> 04:25:39,700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Madagdagan yung sagutin mo.

3834
04:25:39,700 --> 04:25:44,080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ito na lang.

3835
04:25:44,580 --> 04:25:49,700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon tayong programa na New National Irrigation System Subprogram.

3836
04:25:49,860 --> 04:25:55,600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon tayong program na may budget po sa 2025 na 14.3 bilyon. Tama po ba?

3837
04:26:11,180 --> 04:26:19,640
