3855
04:28:11,400 --> 04:28:14,280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Dahil sa hindi pa na-procure, maaring ganun.

3856
04:28:15,700 --> 04:28:15,980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At,

3857
04:28:16,040 --> 04:28:18,600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at,

3858
04:28:19,380 --> 04:28:28,440
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: yung iba naman ho ay, kung sakali man na-procure na po siya, for awarding na siya, for notice to proceed na, makapag-umpisa na rin po sila.

3859
04:28:29,420 --> 04:28:36,860
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya hindi, kasi ganun ho talaga minsan, katulad ho nung ibang pondo natin sa last year,

3860
