Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

4232
05:05:57,660 --> 05:06:00,360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

4233
05:06:02,260 --> 05:06:10,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroon po tayong registry system for basic sectors in agriculture or RSBSA. Tama po ba?

4234
05:06:14,900 --> 05:06:21,040
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, we have, Mr. Speaker and Distinguished Colleague, we have the RSBSA.

4235
05:06:22,300 --> 05:06:23,900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ito po ba ay...

4236
05:06:24,380 --> 05:06:33,300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ginagamit natin ngayon, gumagana po ba ang registry system na ito, Distinguished Sponsor?

4237
05:06:33,920 --> 05:06:39,880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, po. And we use it as a... We are using it, Mr. Speaker.

4238
05:06:41,720 --> 05:06:54,060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Gano po kahalaga ang registry system na ito sa lahat ng ginagawa ng ating Department of Agriculture, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

4239
05:06:54,380 --> 05:06:57,020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mahalaga po ito.

4240
05:06:58,960 --> 05:07:01,920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po, Distinguished Colleague?

4241
05:07:02,780 --> 05:07:16,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Well, we use it po as the basis for determining po yung mga tulong po natin sa seeds, fertilizers, our gas and diesel allowances.

4242
05:07:17,300 --> 05:07:21,500
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, it is the basic registry that makes sure that you are a farmer.

4243
05:07:22,660 --> 05:07:24,360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And nakababa po yan sa bawat area.

4244
05:07:24,380 --> 05:07:30,940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: They are aware kung sino po yung mga magsasaka nila at kung ano po, gano kalaki ho yung sinaka nila.

4245
05:07:31,660 --> 05:07:37,000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they also provide data po who is planting during the wet season, dry season.

4246
05:07:37,300 --> 05:07:41,060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, there's a lot of information contained in the RSBSA.

4247
05:07:42,040 --> 05:07:43,960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

4248
05:07:43,960 --> 05:07:45,960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba yung...

4249
05:07:48,460 --> 05:07:53,740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa panalileksiko na in 2025,

4250
05:07:54,380 --> 05:07:58,380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung failed validation activities natin

4251
05:07:58,380 --> 05:08:04,960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: to update personal and farm parser information

4252
05:08:04,960 --> 05:08:10,560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: were inadequately conducted in nine regions.

4253
05:08:11,480 --> 05:08:12,200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba yun?

4254
05:08:21,220 --> 05:08:24,380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Unfortunately, tama po kayo that the RSBSA does not?

4255
05:08:24,460 --> 05:08:38,900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: It's actually an undercount at hindi po lahat ng mga farmers ay nakaka-capture po ng RSBSA because we are relying a lot on the LGU and the MAO or the Municipal Agricultural Workers.

4256
05:08:38,920 --> 05:08:50,140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But again, limited din po sila. So we do not have direct access to the barangay level, from the municipal to the barangay level because it was devolved.

4257
05:08:50,140 --> 05:08:53,940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But it would be very good if there were extension workers.

4258
05:08:57,220 --> 05:09:17,300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Naitama na po ba ito? Kasi kaya po, kaya ko po naitanong ito dahil marami po tayong mga farmers na nagre-reklamo na hindi nakarating sa kanila yung mga tulong galing sa ating pamahalaan

4259
05:09:17,300 --> 05:09:19,300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: through the Department of...

4260
05:09:20,140 --> 05:09:21,040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ...agriculture.

4261
05:09:22,240 --> 05:09:30,180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Personally, alam ko naman po na maganda po yung pamamalakad ngayon ng Department of Agriculture.

4262
05:09:31,080 --> 05:09:47,040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya ko lang inano tong issue na to dahil may mga nagsasabi sa akin na medyo may problema yung pagkaano natin sa registry system na to na siyang nagiging dahilan.

4263
05:09:47,760 --> 05:09:50,020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon sa problema na yun.

4264
05:09:50,140 --> 05:10:06,800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, can the Distinguished Sponsor commit na maitama po natin yung kung ano man yung mga kamalian

4265
05:10:06,800 --> 05:10:12,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng mga nagdaang taon, mga nagdaang administration sa Department of Agriculture?

4266
05:10:12,940 --> 05:10:19,060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tama po kayo. Tama po kayo that that all, in fact,

4267
05:10:20,140 --> 05:10:24,820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: not all farmers are covered or registered.

4268
05:10:25,140 --> 05:10:32,100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: In fact, a large, I would say, 40% po are not captured by the RSBSA.

4269
05:10:32,580 --> 05:10:36,900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, pag nagbibigayan po ng mga tulong, pag wala po kayo sa RSBSA,

4270
05:10:38,000 --> 05:10:39,460
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: hindi po kayo matutulungan.

4271
05:10:40,160 --> 05:10:43,180
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, actually, to let you know,

4272
05:10:45,380 --> 05:10:47,980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: distinguished speaker and honorable,

4273
05:10:47,980 --> 05:10:51,540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mr. Speaker and Distinguished Colleague,

4274
05:10:51,740 --> 05:10:53,340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: we continue every day.

4275
05:10:54,060 --> 05:11:00,680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: You can go to the MAO or the Municipality and register yourself as a farmer every day.

4276
