Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I-share ko lang po yung nangyari sa amin.

4277
05:11:04,900 --> 05:11:06,220
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi fisher folks po kami.

4278
05:11:06,840 --> 05:11:08,980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And nobody registered themselves kasi malayo.

4279
05:11:10,360 --> 05:11:11,440
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And what's the point?

4280
05:11:12,000 --> 05:11:13,660
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: On the day na nagbigay po ng ayuda,

4281
05:11:13,660 --> 05:11:17,860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and they only received, those who received were those registered.

4282
05:11:17,980 --> 05:11:20,980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: The next day, everybody registered.

4283
05:11:22,680 --> 05:11:26,400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, what we need po are more people.

4284
05:11:26,580 --> 05:11:31,420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: But again, we cannot wait for the farmers to go to the municipio or to the DA.

4285
05:11:32,180 --> 05:11:36,800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tayo mismo, we have to go down and find the farmers and register them.

4286
05:11:37,140 --> 05:11:40,260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, it would help a lot if there were extension workers.

4287
05:11:41,080 --> 05:11:46,240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And the DA is strongly pushing for extension workers down to the barangay level,

4288
05:11:46,240 --> 05:11:47,860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: down to the purok level.

4289
05:11:47,980 --> 05:11:49,280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Who will go around.

4290
05:11:49,400 --> 05:11:50,920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hindi po kaya talaga ng MAO ito.

4291
05:11:51,600 --> 05:11:55,920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And again, mas maganda po talaga sana kung may extension workers.

4292
05:11:57,140 --> 05:11:58,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

4293
05:11:59,080 --> 05:12:01,200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang hinahanap po lang is,

4294
