Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: What concrete steps that the Department of Agriculture is doing at present

4296
05:12:14,980 --> 05:12:17,980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para lang ma-resolve itong issue sa region?

4297
05:12:17,980 --> 05:12:20,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang mag-registration natin ng ating mga farmers.

4298
05:12:21,060 --> 05:12:29,760
