06:35:46,960 --> 06:35:51,140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: where it is required under the Philippines' international fisheries obligations,

5847
06:35:51,800 --> 06:36:02,560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: including it as a condition for access to the waters of other coastal states and to fishing grounds managed by the regional fishing management organizations.

5848
06:36:02,880 --> 06:36:14,620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, yes, humina po ang BFAR's enforcement capabilities, but they are still doing their best po.

5849
06:36:16,960 --> 06:36:24,720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: They retain alternative enforcement tools, including vessel inspection, sea patrol, onboard observers, etc.

5850
06:36:24,940 --> 06:36:28,200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Marami po silang ginagawa, so we are happy to share that with you, Mr. Speaker.

5851
06:36:28,840 --> 06:36:38,620
