08:31:48,280 --> 08:31:49,560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sinsay lang po natin, no?

8009
08:31:49,740 --> 08:31:51,060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So since marami po yan,

8010
08:31:51,460 --> 08:31:53,560
