Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hanggang 20 years.

8030
08:32:47,460 --> 08:32:49,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So ang inuna po talaga ng Bureau of Fire ngayon,

8031
08:32:50,220 --> 08:32:52,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na po yung mga 40-year-old na fire trucks,

8032
08:32:52,540 --> 08:32:54,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so wala pong politika,

8033
08:32:55,580 --> 08:32:56,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but depending sa necessity

8034
08:32:56,540 --> 08:32:59,420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng ating local government units,

8035
08:32:59,900 --> 08:33:01,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and we want this done.

8036
08:33:02,020 --> 08:33:03,600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: All we need is the release.

8037
08:33:04,460 --> 08:33:07,720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And with the supervision of our good secretary

8038
08:33:07,720 --> 08:33:09,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: who cleansed the BFP,

8039
08:33:10,420 --> 08:33:12,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and even going to a government-to-government,

8040
08:33:13,000 --> 08:33:14,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so mas magiging pong madali,

8041
08:33:14,700 --> 08:33:15,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: magiging transparent,

8042
08:33:16,300 --> 08:33:17,760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and sasabi ko may accountability,

8043
08:33:18,600 --> 08:33:20,780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: wala pong korupsyon na pwedeng mangyari.

8044
