Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: even po yung ating equipment,

8051
08:33:35,300 --> 08:33:37,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and even po yung ating ambulansya,

8052
08:33:37,900 --> 08:33:39,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and lahat po ng personnel,

8053
08:33:39,340 --> 08:33:40,860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: mga nurses natin, sinabi natin,

8054
08:33:40,980 --> 08:33:42,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: NC2, very well equipped,

8055
