Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: para sa sampung taon,

8080
08:34:43,460 --> 08:34:45,900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kumpleto na po yung ating personnel sa BFP,

8081
08:34:46,520 --> 08:34:47,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil hindi lang po

8082
