9573
09:16:26,360 --> 09:16:33,220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, at magandang gabi po sa ating ginoong sponsor at ang kanyang kapwa-sponsor

9574
09:16:33,220 --> 09:16:37,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at sa ating pong DILG family, attached agencies. Magandang gabi po sa inyo.

9575
09:16:38,240 --> 09:16:43,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nabalitaan po natin ang denial ng asylum request ni Harry Roque.

9576
09:16:44,300 --> 09:16:48,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maybe here confirmation or an update from the DILG regarding this matter.

9577
09:16:48,680 --> 09:16:51,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Legal yan.

9578
09:17:03,360 --> 09:17:11,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Normal courses is six months. It passed already, neither approved or disapproved.

9579
09:17:14,360 --> 09:17:18,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Regarding red notice, all documents, yun naunaan ko na eh.

9580
09:17:19,300 --> 09:17:21,760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: All documents requested by the Interpreter.

9581
09:17:21,760 --> 09:17:24,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Interpol have been submitted by the PCTC.

9582
09:17:25,820 --> 09:17:31,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Are we looking at a timeline kung kailan po natin maiuwi si Harry Roque dito para mapanagot sa kanyang mga kasalanan?

9583
09:17:35,260 --> 09:17:38,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We will have to follow up with the Interpol, Mr. Speaker.

9584
09:17:40,580 --> 09:17:47,700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, thank you very much, Mr. Sponsor, for the response to that very crucial question at this point in time.

9585
09:17:48,140 --> 09:17:51,700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po, nababahala ang taong bayan na

9586
09:17:51,760 --> 09:17:55,820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ginagawa at inaabuso ng mga pugante ang proseso ng political asylum.

9587
09:17:55,820 --> 09:18:00,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Iba ang political persecution sa totoong nagkasala sa batas.

9588
09:18:00,340 --> 09:18:04,700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And no less than a former law school from the UP College of Law should know this.

9589
09:18:05,060 --> 09:18:08,220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to another topic, Mr. Speaker, Ginong Sponsor.

9590
09:18:08,640 --> 09:18:10,920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let's talk about the 911 hotline.

9591
09:18:11,580 --> 09:18:20,380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ayon po sa DILG, Unified 911 Emergency System officially went live last year in NCR, BARMM, Region 1, and Region 7.

9592
09:18:20,640 --> 09:18:21,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero sabi na,

9593
09:18:21,740 --> 09:18:25,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa PNP, nakadepende ang reliability ng hotline sa signal strength.

9594
09:18:27,120 --> 09:18:31,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: In areas with weak or no mobile signal, emergency calls may face connectivity issues.

9595
09:18:32,780 --> 09:18:37,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po ng ating mga kababayan, ibig sabihin po ba nito kapag walang signal, wala ding response?

9596
09:18:37,940 --> 09:18:41,600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May plano po ba ang DILG na magkaroon ng redundancy o offline system?

9597
09:18:42,440 --> 09:18:50,660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, naandyan po, but we have to coordinate also with DICT since sa mandato rin po nila yan.

9598
09:18:51,740 --> 09:18:59,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May pinamimigay na nga po ng mga Starlink, lalo na sa mga schools, lalo na sa mga walang signal na mga areas.

9599
09:18:59,840 --> 09:19:08,800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So DILG is already coordinating with DICT para wala pong duplication sa ating pong pagagasahan, lalo na kung walang signal ang lugar.

9600
09:19:10,240 --> 09:19:14,220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po, Mr. Speaker, yun na, banggit na ating ginong sponsor, dapat walang duplication.

9601
09:19:14,220 --> 09:19:20,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, there's a directive ng DICT, may last mile po sila.

9602
09:19:20,400 --> 09:19:21,720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, last mile.

9603
09:19:21,740 --> 09:19:24,900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, yung kadulod-duluhan po, kailangan po magkasignal.

9604
09:19:26,060 --> 09:19:28,160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, ginong sponsor, Mr. Speaker.

9605
09:19:28,280 --> 09:19:34,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong lamang po ay, so sa dulo po, kaninong budget kukuhanin yung ating investment for this last mile effort?

9606
09:19:35,540 --> 09:19:39,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's with the private sector, actually.

9607
09:19:41,320 --> 09:19:42,420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Telcos po talaga.

9608
09:19:43,200 --> 09:19:47,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But since may kakulangan, mapasok po yung nag-intervene ng government.

9609
09:19:47,980 --> 09:19:50,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Lalo na sa mga coastal areas.

9610
09:19:51,740 --> 09:19:53,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Wala pong telco na nakapasok.

9611
09:19:55,540 --> 09:20:03,240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nito pong nakaraang Augusto, may pagkaantala sa emergency response sa isang senior citizen sa Taguig.

9612
09:20:03,340 --> 09:20:07,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po'y napabalita at nakalalungkot po dahil namatay siya kinalaunan.

9613
09:20:08,120 --> 09:20:14,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Paano po tinitiyak ng DILG na maayos ang coordination between our 911 dispatchers and our medical response units?

9614
09:20:15,300 --> 09:20:18,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ma'am, Mr. Speaker, can we get more specific?

9615
09:20:18,240 --> 09:20:21,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Since nabanggit ko naman po kanina na...

9616
09:20:21,740 --> 09:20:25,200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sa 911, million-million po yung tumatawag.

9617
09:20:25,360 --> 09:20:32,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, can you, I'll ask your indulgence to give us more specific data regarding this matter

9618
09:20:32,280 --> 09:20:40,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so that we can answer appropriately and take action appropriately also, Mr. Speaker.

9619
09:20:40,500 --> 09:20:45,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor, we will forward to your office the details of this incident in Taguig.

9620
09:20:45,120 --> 09:20:47,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But this was widely reported in media.

9621
09:20:48,160 --> 09:20:50,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me go to the more general question of how do we ensure...

9622
09:20:50,940 --> 09:20:55,700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung mabilis na coordination between our dispatchers and our medical response units?

9623
09:20:55,700 --> 09:20:58,620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, all the 911 are all recorded.

9624
09:20:58,980 --> 09:21:04,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's why sa data po natin, nakikita natin may prank call, ilan yung totoo, ilan po yung nasagi po natin.

9625
09:21:05,120 --> 09:21:07,560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we have these datas, Mr. Speaker.

9626
09:21:08,240 --> 09:21:14,460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, kung meron po tayong naganyang datos, ilan na po ang natanggap na calls at ilan na po ang natugunan nating mga kababayan

9627
09:21:14,460 --> 09:21:17,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa ating 911 service, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor?

9628
09:21:17,480 --> 09:21:19,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, I'll just pull up the data again.

9629
09:21:19,520 --> 09:21:34,800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The calls is about 14,461,871 incoming calls.

9630
09:21:35,900 --> 09:21:40,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 13,931,388 handled calls.

9631
09:21:41,400 --> 09:21:44,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 96.33% handling efficiency.

9632
09:21:47,640 --> 09:21:48,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 530,483 abandoned.

9633
09:21:49,520 --> 09:21:55,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 17,469 documented prank calls.

9634
09:21:56,040 --> 09:22:01,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The volume is approximately 53,000 incoming calls per day.

9635
09:22:01,720 --> 09:22:05,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, if we get the specific, lalo yung sa Taguig, dahil recorded naman po yun,

9636
09:22:06,140 --> 09:22:09,600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kaya po natin malaman kung ano po yung nangyari po talaga doon.

9637
09:22:10,440 --> 09:22:12,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor.

9638
09:22:12,620 --> 09:22:19,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, mukha pong napaka-critical na serbisyo ito na kailangan-kailangan na ating bayan at dahan-dahan pong...

9639
09:22:19,520 --> 09:22:22,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ina-avail at niyayakap ng ating mga kababayan ang serbisyong ito.

9640
09:22:22,740 --> 09:22:27,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, ang tanong ay magkano po ang pondo na nakalaan sa emergency response vehicles

9641
09:22:27,680 --> 09:22:32,940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at infrastructure ng 911 command centers sa iba't-ibang mga regions sa Pilipinas?

9642
09:22:33,080 --> 09:22:38,120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, can I be clarified of funding for this year or for the 2027?

9643
09:22:38,580 --> 09:22:40,040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For the... for 2027.

9644
09:22:40,040 --> 09:22:45,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: For 2027 is P224 million.

9645
09:22:46,680 --> 09:22:49,040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakaliit po para sa entire...

9646
09:22:49,520 --> 09:22:49,960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Philippines.

9647
09:22:50,660 --> 09:22:52,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, on top of the current...

9648
09:22:52,340 --> 09:22:56,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's why we are asking for additional funds, Mr. Speaker.

9649
09:22:56,980 --> 09:22:59,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we will help the good sponsor get to that particular point.

9650
09:23:00,600 --> 09:23:13,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, kung kailangan po natin additional funds, dito po sa current entry sa ating pong GAB na allocation for our command centers and response vehicles,

9651
09:23:13,380 --> 09:23:15,920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ilang regions po ang madagdag at makukover natin?

9652
09:23:18,840 --> 09:23:19,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, we have...

9653
09:23:19,520 --> 09:23:23,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We have 10 satellite command centers nationwide.

9654
09:23:24,680 --> 09:23:26,800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Catered na po lahat ng region po na yan.

9655
09:23:26,980 --> 09:23:27,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Lahat?

9656
09:23:28,960 --> 09:23:30,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Lahat ng region at yung...

9657
09:23:30,280 --> 09:23:32,300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Language sensitive rin po yun, ha?

9658
09:23:32,740 --> 09:23:33,020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Okay.

9659
09:23:33,240 --> 09:23:39,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, magkano po yung kailangan pa nating dagdag to be able to not just cater to the needs of these regions,

9660
09:23:39,640 --> 09:23:42,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: but to establish robust systems in this region?

9661
09:23:43,340 --> 09:23:46,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Napakaliit lang po for the 96.33% efficiency.

9662
09:23:47,560 --> 09:23:49,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 372 million lang po ang kailangan.

9663
09:23:49,520 --> 09:23:52,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: One more time, Mr. Speaker, ginawang sponsor for the record.

9664
09:23:54,380 --> 09:23:57,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 372 million ang kailangan.

9665
09:23:58,360 --> 09:24:01,300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 372 million. And that would translate to what exactly?

9666
09:24:02,040 --> 09:24:03,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 373 million.

9667
09:24:05,080 --> 09:24:10,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: This will provide an additional appropriate for the Bureau's emergency...

9668
09:24:12,040 --> 09:24:15,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: operating costs, Mr. Speaker.

9669
09:24:19,520 --> 09:24:21,520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Would that be additional operating costs?

9670
09:24:21,760 --> 09:24:24,240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Meron po ba itong dimension ng capital outlay?

9671
09:24:27,780 --> 09:24:30,480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Iba po yun ang request for the ambulances naman po.

9672
09:24:30,560 --> 09:24:31,660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We're talking about the 911.

9673
09:24:32,660 --> 09:24:35,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 373 million po yung kailangan po natin for 2027.

9674
09:24:36,240 --> 09:24:38,380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, ginawang sponsor.

9675
09:24:38,380 --> 09:24:41,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Tayo po sa Akbayan ay nag-file ng House Bill 8417,

9676
09:24:42,180 --> 09:24:46,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: which institutionalizes an emergency medical services system in the country.

9677
09:24:46,560 --> 09:24:48,720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa panahon ng emergency, every second counts.

9678
09:24:48,860 --> 09:24:49,380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we are counting...

9679
09:24:49,520 --> 09:24:53,300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: counting on the support of the DILG for this very important piece of legislation.

9680
09:24:54,400 --> 09:24:57,320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to an issue that's very close to my heart

9681
09:24:57,320 --> 09:24:59,520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: as former Commissioner of the National Youth Commission.

9682
09:25:00,240 --> 09:25:04,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po yung transparency and public disclosure of SK funds.

9683
09:25:05,900 --> 09:25:10,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sabi sa isang Joint Memorandum Circular ng DILG, NYC, at DBM,

9684
09:25:10,480 --> 09:25:15,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: required ang SK Councils na i-post ang kanilang Comprehensive Barangay Youth Development Plan,

9685
09:25:15,280 --> 09:25:19,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Annual Barangay Youth Investment Program, Resolutions and Statements,

9686
09:25:19,520 --> 09:25:24,140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: of Receipts and Expenditures sa SK Full Disclosure Policy Board.

9687
09:25:24,280 --> 09:25:27,060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Again, this is a physical policy board.

9688
09:25:27,540 --> 09:25:32,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Although hindi mandatory, highly encouraged din ang mga SK na ipost ang mga ito online.

9689
09:25:32,500 --> 09:25:38,040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Would we know po kung ilang porsyento ng mga barangay ang may social media posting of their SK budget,

9690
09:25:38,340 --> 09:25:41,540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the CBYDP, or quarterly financial statements?

9691
09:25:41,640 --> 09:25:41,920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you.

9692
09:25:44,740 --> 09:25:47,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As of now, Mr. Speaker, wala po.

9693
09:25:47,860 --> 09:25:49,360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But we will look...

9694
09:25:49,360 --> 09:25:50,020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Look into it.

9695
09:25:51,340 --> 09:25:53,260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor.

9696
09:25:53,400 --> 09:25:55,560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa tingin po ba ng DILG at ng NYC,

9697
09:25:55,960 --> 09:26:00,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pwede nating gawing mandatory policy ang social media posting for transparency?

9698
09:26:01,580 --> 09:26:03,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Speaker. Totally agree.

9699
09:26:04,460 --> 09:26:05,620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat po.

9700
09:26:05,980 --> 09:26:09,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we feel strongly about this, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor,

9701
09:26:09,840 --> 09:26:13,960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kasi nga po naniniwala tayo nung ating binoo ang SK Reform Law,

9702
09:26:14,560 --> 09:26:18,020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na dapat hindi maging breeding ground for corruption ng SK,

9703
09:26:18,120 --> 09:26:19,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at maging training ground.

9704
09:26:19,360 --> 09:26:21,340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For transparency and accountability.

9705
09:26:21,940 --> 09:26:26,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We hope that DILG and NYC can make this a mandatory policy the soonest time possible.

9706
09:26:27,340 --> 09:26:29,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May we get the commitment of the good sponsor.

9707
09:26:29,680 --> 09:26:30,720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we are committed to do that.

9708
09:26:31,200 --> 09:26:32,520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Speaker.

9709
09:26:32,740 --> 09:26:37,060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to a very painful and sensitive topic for the nation right now.

9710
09:26:37,860 --> 09:26:41,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa pagitan po ng initial budget hearings at plenary debates,

9711
09:26:42,180 --> 09:26:45,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nakalulungkot po na may isa na naman tayong hinarap na insidente ng school shooting.

9712
09:26:46,420 --> 09:26:48,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Three children were dead while eight were injured.

9713
09:26:49,360 --> 09:26:52,140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Katulad naman ang nakaraang kaso ng school violence,

9714
09:26:52,300 --> 09:26:57,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang baril na ginamit sa nasabing isidente ay government-issued firearm.

9715
09:26:57,520 --> 09:27:01,940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya nga po napakasakit isipin na para mga baril na galing sa gobyerno

9716
09:27:01,940 --> 09:27:03,900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang pumapatay sa ating mga bata.

9717
09:27:05,280 --> 09:27:07,240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Batay din sa initial report ng pulisya,

9718
09:27:07,440 --> 09:27:12,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: maaaring maimpluensyahan din ang mga bata sa mga true crime community sa deep dark web.

9719
09:27:13,160 --> 09:27:14,880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po ang tanong natin sa DILG,

9720
09:27:14,880 --> 09:27:18,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano po ang ginagawa ng DILG at PNP patungkol po sa insidenteng ito?

9721
09:27:19,360 --> 09:27:24,620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Speaker, we have to amend some legislation,

9722
09:27:25,400 --> 09:27:29,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: especially regarding the firearms.

9723
09:27:29,940 --> 09:27:31,880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sad to say, Mr. Speaker, yung mga baril,

9724
09:27:32,360 --> 09:27:35,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sila nakuha sa tatay, nakuha sa auntie,

9725
09:27:35,720 --> 09:27:36,360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so sa relative.

9726
09:27:37,160 --> 09:27:39,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So we need the legislation,

9727
09:27:40,140 --> 09:27:43,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na po sa mga license na tumahawak ng baril,

9728
09:27:43,220 --> 09:27:47,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: to safekeep ang kanilang pong firearms.

9729
09:27:48,740 --> 09:27:48,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But,

9730
09:27:49,360 --> 09:27:52,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: this is not only the problem of the government.

9731
09:27:54,240 --> 09:27:55,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As I've said a while ago,

9732
09:27:55,940 --> 09:27:58,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I think this is a social problem.

9733
09:27:59,320 --> 09:28:02,780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Especially with Facebook,

9734
09:28:03,820 --> 09:28:04,460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Meta,

9735
09:28:05,340 --> 09:28:06,880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: fake news, etc.

9736
09:28:07,640 --> 09:28:10,480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But the DILG is doing something about it.

9737
09:28:11,400 --> 09:28:12,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And this is no joke.

9738
09:28:13,400 --> 09:28:16,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Even Congress is doing something about it.

9739
09:28:16,820 --> 09:28:17,740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We have to regulate,

9740
09:28:18,440 --> 09:28:19,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: especially the use

9741
09:28:19,360 --> 09:28:20,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: of Facebook,

9742
09:28:21,500 --> 09:28:22,780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: especially to our kids.

9743
09:28:23,880 --> 09:28:24,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang nakakalungkot po,

9744
09:28:25,100 --> 09:28:29,500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kabataan po ang tinatarget ng mga terrorist acts

9745
09:28:29,500 --> 09:28:32,440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: who are brainwashing our kids.

9746
09:28:32,920 --> 09:28:35,120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But it is through legislation also

9747
09:28:35,120 --> 09:28:38,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: that we can empower our law enforcement,

9748
09:28:38,800 --> 09:28:43,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na kung mas lalo pa nating palawakin yung parusa,

9749
09:28:44,160 --> 09:28:47,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na sa may may-ari ng mga firearms.

9750
09:28:47,920 --> 09:28:48,920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you.

9751
09:28:49,360 --> 09:28:49,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker,

9752
09:28:49,940 --> 09:28:51,020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ginong sponsor,

9753
09:28:51,140 --> 09:28:53,260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: we join you in this call for

9754
09:28:53,260 --> 09:28:54,500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: not just the whole of government,

9755
09:28:54,680 --> 09:28:56,180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: but the whole of nation approach

9756
09:28:56,180 --> 09:28:58,320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: in addressing gun violence in our schools.

9757
09:28:58,660 --> 09:29:00,940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me just put a pin on the legislation part

9758
09:29:00,940 --> 09:29:04,540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and we'll do that later in this part of my interpellation

9759
09:29:04,540 --> 09:29:07,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and go back to the issue of gun control.

9760
09:29:07,700 --> 09:29:10,800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang DILG po ba at ang PNP ay bukas na mag-conduct

9761
09:29:10,800 --> 09:29:14,400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng comprehensive safety audit at physical accounting

9762
09:29:14,400 --> 09:29:17,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng lahat ng government-issued firearms sa bansa?

9763
09:29:17,020 --> 09:29:17,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

9764
09:29:17,820 --> 09:29:19,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, PNP is doing it.

9765
09:29:19,340 --> 09:29:19,740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: PNP is doing it already.

9766
09:29:21,720 --> 09:29:25,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: That's welcome development and good news from the DILG.

9767
09:29:25,280 --> 09:29:27,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang DILG po ba at ang PNP, Mr. Speaker,

9768
09:29:27,600 --> 09:29:28,180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ginong sponsor,

9769
09:29:28,420 --> 09:29:31,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ay open into reviewing guidelines

9770
09:29:31,280 --> 09:29:34,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: on physical possession, authorization, condition,

9771
09:29:34,980 --> 09:29:37,400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and safekeeping of government-issued firearms?

9772
09:29:37,640 --> 09:29:38,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

9773
09:29:39,700 --> 09:29:40,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So we will await...

9774
09:29:40,480 --> 09:29:41,900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Not only government, but all.

9775
09:29:42,900 --> 09:29:48,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Not only sa government firearms, but all.

9776
09:29:48,080 --> 09:29:49,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: All firearms.

9777
09:29:50,180 --> 09:29:53,140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: That's very good, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor.

9778
09:29:53,440 --> 09:29:55,180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: On behalf of Akbayan Party-list po,

9779
09:29:55,520 --> 09:29:58,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: this representation would like to extend our sincerest condolences

9780
09:29:58,200 --> 09:30:00,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to the families affected by...

9781
09:30:00,000 --> 09:30:08,900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: By violence in schools, lahat po tayo naniniwalang ang paaralan ang pangalawang tahanan ng ating mga anak, kaya dapat masiguro nating ligtas sila sa karahasan.

9782
09:30:09,580 --> 09:30:14,120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Isa pong nakita natin na pinropose recently is the use of transparent bags.

9783
09:30:14,820 --> 09:30:23,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mayroon po bang efforts ang DILG and PNP in cooperation with the DepEd to look into the efficacy of using transparent bags for our school children?

9784
09:30:23,660 --> 09:30:34,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, but it's a DepEd policy, but the DALG is working with DepEd and even DSWD, and even DICT, Mr. Speaker.

9785
09:30:34,720 --> 09:30:44,360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So nakita ko po sa balita that the DepEd is giving a certain policy pertaining to this, and we hope that the DALG and even the DSWD would be able to join this effort,

9786
09:30:44,760 --> 09:30:49,900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: especially po dahil dagdag na gastos na naman ito, ito'y matutuloy, ngunit kinakailangan talaga.

9787
09:30:49,900 --> 09:30:53,440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung nakatransparent bag lamang po yung mga batang pumapasok sa eskwela,

9788
09:30:53,660 --> 09:30:58,780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: makikita, mas mahirapang itago yung mga baril po na maaaring nakatago at patalim na naroon,

9789
09:30:59,140 --> 09:31:02,840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: dahil wala po talagang espasyo ang baril at patalim sa loob ng ating mga eskwelahan.

9790
09:31:03,280 --> 09:31:10,980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And in light with this, we have filed House Bill 158, prescribing measures to address child safety against gun violence.

9791
09:31:11,440 --> 09:31:18,880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We are also planning to file a resolution to urge the conduct of a safety audit of all government-issued firearms to designated personnel.

9792
09:31:18,880 --> 09:31:23,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We hope that the DALG and the PNP would put this concern,

9793
09:31:23,280 --> 09:31:24,480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: as a top priority.

9794
09:31:24,800 --> 09:31:30,760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: That would be my last question, Mr. Speaker, ginong sponsor, at marami pong salamat sa inyo at sa DALG family.

9795
09:31:31,240 --> 09:31:33,000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

9796
09:31:33,580 --> 09:31:39,880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Just for the record, ito na po yung ginagawa, actions taken ng ginagawa ng ating pong DALG, especially the PNP.

9797
09:31:40,580 --> 09:31:43,460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Assistance in schools during the opening and closing of classes.

9798
09:31:44,480 --> 09:31:50,660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Intensification of public safety operation and preventive measures for OPLAN, Balik Eskwela School,

9799
09:31:50,660 --> 09:31:52,660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: School Year 2026-2027.

9800
09:31:53,280 --> 09:31:57,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: To address the emerging safety.

9801
09:31:58,880 --> 09:32:02,760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Intensification of police visibility and security assistance in schools.

9802
09:32:04,940 --> 09:32:10,280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Operational guidelines for OPLAN, Balik Eskwela School Year 2026-2027.

9803
09:32:11,840 --> 09:32:14,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Reiteration of enhanced policy visibility in schools.

9804
09:32:15,440 --> 09:32:19,820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Reiteration on the intensification of police visibility and security assistance in schools.

9805
09:32:20,620 --> 09:32:23,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Reiteration on the intensification of

9806
09:32:23,340 --> 09:32:25,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: police visibility and security assistance in schools.

9807
09:32:27,120 --> 09:32:31,240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And strategies to strengthen school safety and security.

9808
09:32:31,480 --> 09:32:35,300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And to add, ang ating kapulisan ay tine-train rin po

9809
09:32:35,720 --> 09:32:37,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang ating pong mga barangay tanod.

9810
09:32:37,380 --> 09:32:42,000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Alam po natin na hindi po kaya ng ating kapulisan with their numbers, sheer numbers,

9811
09:32:42,060 --> 09:32:46,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na protektahan ng milyones na ating pong mga kababayan

9812
09:32:46,700 --> 09:32:51,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but we are coordinating already, we're asking help from LGUs,

9813
09:32:51,960 --> 09:32:53,040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: especially the barangay tanods.

9814
09:32:53,040 --> 09:32:54,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: barangay, especially the barangay

9815
09:32:54,960 --> 09:32:56,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: tanods, para po

9816
09:32:56,340 --> 09:32:58,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ma-insure ang safety ng ating

9817
09:32:58,920 --> 09:33:00,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pong mga kabataan.

9818
09:33:01,040 --> 09:33:02,740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat, Mr. Speaker, Mr.

9819
09:33:02,840 --> 09:33:04,700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sponsor. Again, we need a whole of nation

9820
09:33:04,700 --> 09:33:06,680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: approach to address the issue of

9821
09:33:06,680 --> 09:33:08,660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: safety of our children in schools

9822
09:33:08,660 --> 09:33:10,640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and our communities. Muli po, magandang gabi.

9823
09:33:11,440 --> 09:33:12,980
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much. Majority Leader.

9824
09:33:14,200 --> 09:33:14,920
Floor Speaker: Mr. Speaker,

9825
09:33:15,080 --> 09:33:16,860
Floor Speaker: next to interpellate, I move to

9826
