Floor Speaker: recognize Representative

9827
09:33:18,580 --> 09:33:20,660
Floor Speaker: Sarah Elago of Gabriela

9828
09:33:20,660 --> 09:33:22,760
Floor Speaker: Women's Party to interpellate.

9829
09:33:23,040 --> 09:33:24,760
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentlelady from Gabriela

9830
09:33:24,760 --> 09:33:26,840
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Women's Party, Representative Sarah

9831
09:33:26,840 --> 09:33:28,280
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Jane Elago, is recognized.

